    file_read_has_23_definitions_with_two_return_types_2026-08-16, 1014, "2026-11-05 rel100-armfix: PARTIAL return-type spread already closed; consolidated all fs/io/file/sqlite-lane copies onto the single blessed pub fn file_read in src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/io_runtime.spl (16->9 definitions; remaining 9 are out-of-lane in src/app, src/os, compiler internals, gc_async_mut runtime, async mcp; full convergence blocked by documented compiler-hang hazard) (evidence: test/01_unit/lib/file_read_canonical_facade_spec.spl 4/4 + file_read_single_return_type_spec.spl 9/9 + io_runtime_alias_collision_spec.spl 2/2 interpreted)"
    file_read_has_23_definitions_with_two_return_types_2026-08-16, 1019, "2026-11-05 rel100-r2: PARTIAL converged all 7 remaining lane-owned copies (src/app/io/mod_stub, src/app/semihost/reader, src/os/apps/vcs/vcs_app, src/lib/gc_async_mut/pure/runtime, src/lib/nogc_async_mut/mcp/{bugdb_resource,resources,main_lazy_json}) onto the blessed io_runtime.file_read — lane copies 10 -> 0; 4 definitions left tree-wide (1 blessed + 3 in src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/src/{config,exp/config,exp/storage}.spl owned by another lane; src/compiler internals excluded per documented hang hazard). Guards: file_read_canonical_facade 4/4, file_read_single_return_type 9/9, io_runtime_alias_collision 2/2, mcp_bugdb 6/6, vcs_system_test 24/24 via run mode."

